## Implementation Requirements

### Development Environment
The framework's development environment configuration is defined in `defaults/environment.json`. This file contains all environment-specific settings and is used to generate the appropriate configuration for different contexts.

### Documentation Organization
- Framework documentation in /docs/framework/
  - Methodology overview (REQUIRED)
  - Best practices (REQUIRED)
  - Implementation patterns (REQUIRED)
  - Troubleshooting guides (REQUIRED)
  - Vibe Coder's Guide (REQUIRED)
  - Style guides (OPTIONAL)
  - Example projects (REQUIRED)
- Development guides in /docs/development/
  - Setup instructions (REQUIRED)
  - Workflow guides (REQUIRED)
  - Testing procedures (REQUIRED)
  - Tool integration (OPTIONAL)
  - Visual tutorials (REQUIRED)
  - Run guides (REQUIRED)
- User preferences in /docs/user/
  - Core preferences (REQUIRED)
  - Communication guidelines (REQUIRED)
  - Configuration options (User-generated)
  - Customization guides (User-generated)
  - User-specific settings (User-generated)
- Default configurations in /docs/defaults/
  - Standard templates (REQUIRED)
  - Testing templates (REQUIRED)
  - Copyright templates (REQUIRED)
  - API templates (OPTIONAL)
  - Security templates (OPTIONAL)
  - Framework templates (OPTIONAL)
  - Settings templates (OPTIONAL)

### File Structure
```
project_root/
├── .cursorrules             # Development framework rules
├── SPECIFICATIONS.md        # Project definition
├── README.md               # Framework overview and usage
├── .gitignore              # Standard exclusions
├── docs/                   # Framework documentation
    ├── framework/          # Core framework documentation
    │   ├── methodology/    # Required methodology docs
    │   ├── best_practices/ # Required best practices
    │   ├── patterns/       # Required patterns
    │   └── style/          # Optional style guides
    ├── development/        # Development documentation
    │   ├── setup/          # Required setup docs
    │   ├── workflow/       # Required workflow docs
    │   ├── testing/        # Required testing docs
    │   └── documentation/  # Required doc guidelines
    ├── user/               # User documentation
    │   ├── preferences/    # Required preferences
    │   ├── communication/  # Required communication
    │   ├── config/         # User-generated config
    │   └── custom/         # User-generated custom
    └── defaults/           # Default configurations
        └── templates/      # Various templates
            ├── copyright/  # Required copyright
            ├── testing/    # Required testing
            ├── config/     # Required config
            ├── api/        # Optional API
            ├── security/   # Optional security
            ├── framework/  # Optional framework
            └── settings/   # Optional settings
```

